silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_02_probe_tsn_identity_concrete_anchor_1#taxrowtsn183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The TaxRowTSN183798 is The ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus with TSN 183798; source of the identification arrow iota_tsn into Mittens. The TSN number is a field of this row, not a separate object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TaxRow_{TSN 183798}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
